WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.280
- But your Christmas special
airs tonight NBC, right?

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.840
- Yeah, and it's great.
- Are you excited?

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:04.673
(audience applauding)

00:00:04.673 --> 00:00:06.690
I love doing Christmas specials.

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:09.300
Look at all that talent on the stage.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.740
- I know, it's great.
- Yes!

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:11.580
- It's a great show.

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:14.310
I was able to put in some of the hits

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:16.500
and the Christmas songs,

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.810
and you don't even know
which one is coming.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.220
And it's really great.
- Oh, I like that.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.053
- Yeah.

00:00:21.053 --> 00:00:21.930
- Oh, that's really cool to do

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:23.010
because people always want,

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:24.600
yeah, they always wanna
hear like the hits as well,

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:25.620
so that's really smart.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:26.453
- Yeah.

00:00:26.453 --> 00:00:27.286
- I'm not that smart.

00:00:27.286 --> 00:00:28.860
I've never done that.
(Barry laughing)

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:30.480
But we heard that they
wouldn't let you have puppies,

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:31.957
that you wanted puppies.
- Well, yeah.

00:00:31.957 --> 00:00:32.790
How did you know that?

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:33.623
- I know.

00:00:33.623 --> 00:00:34.456
Well, I like puppies.

00:00:34.456 --> 00:00:35.289
- I've got everything.

00:00:35.289 --> 00:00:36.900
It snows on the audience,

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.810
and there's presents, and there's trees.

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:40.830
And I thought...

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:41.970
And little children.

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:44.580
The little kids come running
out, and Santa Claus.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:45.690
- Magical.
- Everything.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:46.590
So we had everything.

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:48.300
And I said, "Gee, wouldn't it be great

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:51.090
if we had like a puppy for
one of the little kids?"

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:51.923
- Wouldn't it be great?

00:00:51.923 --> 00:00:53.310
Let's bring Barry a puppy.

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:54.676
He didn't get a puppy.
(audience cheering)

00:00:54.676 --> 00:00:56.008
We've got puppies.
(jingle bells ringing)

00:00:56.008 --> 00:00:57.619
Look at these cute, cute puppies.

00:00:57.619 --> 00:00:59.637
(audience cheering)

00:00:59.637 --> 00:01:02.179
(Barry laughing)

00:01:02.179 --> 00:01:03.075
Oh my God.

00:01:03.075 --> 00:01:05.419
Could I hold one?
- Oh my goodness.

00:01:05.419 --> 00:01:07.866
- This is Spot.
(Kelly screaming)

00:01:07.866 --> 00:01:10.283
- Oh, how old?
- This is Tiny.

00:01:11.155 --> 00:01:12.720
- Oh my goodness.
- Hello.

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:13.743
- Oh my goodness.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:16.485
What's your name?

00:01:16.485 --> 00:01:17.318
Oh, you little...

00:01:17.318 --> 00:01:19.650
- Barry, this is dangerous.

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:21.183
I do not need another dog.

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:24.810
Oh my God, everybody, I should
mention these puppies are

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:27.720
Spot and Tiny from the
Brixies Rescue Center.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:30.420
And you can find out how you
can adopt them or their friends

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:32.940
by heading to our show's
Instagram stories.

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:35.250
You're sweet.
(audience exclaiming)

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:36.660
Hello.

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:37.983
Hello.
- I think she recognizes me.

00:01:37.983 --> 00:01:39.030
- [Kelly] See, she did.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:41.193
She was like-
- Do you have all my albums?

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:43.020
- "Mandy" is her favorite.

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.520
You're trying to get to my coffee, bruh.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:46.200
Nah.
(audience laughing)

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:49.440
I hear that you actually ended
up breaking Elvis's record

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:51.240
in Vegas with the most live shows, right?

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:52.073
- That was great.

00:01:52.073 --> 00:01:53.190
It it was an honor.
- That's insane.

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:54.649
- It really was an honor.
(audience cheering)

00:01:54.649 --> 00:01:56.640
- 'Cause any time people think of Vegas,

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:58.620
you think of Elvis and
all those live shows.

00:01:58.620 --> 00:01:59.453
- Yeah.

00:01:59.453 --> 00:02:00.286
- And you have trumped him, I like it.

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:03.840
- Yeah, and you know, on
that day I sang "Hound Dog?"

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:04.673
- [Kelly] Oh, did you?

00:02:04.673 --> 00:02:06.360
- Me singing "Hound Dog?"
- Why not?

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:08.430
- And I jiggled around
a little bit, like...

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:09.900
- Yeah.
(audience laughing)

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:10.733
I like it.

00:02:10.733 --> 00:02:12.030
You gotta jiggle a little, it's Elvis.

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:12.870
Oh, they're like crying.

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:14.610
Do you wanna go run around?

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:15.810
Maybe they wanna run around.

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:16.643
I don't know.
- Should we do it?

00:02:16.643 --> 00:02:18.180
- Do you want down or do you want...

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:19.290
Do you want down?

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:20.670
- You want go down?
- We're gonna let 'em down.

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:21.540
Let 'em free.

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.310
Let 'em be free.
- Okay.

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:24.810
Okay, ready?
- Here we go.

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:27.210
- Ready, run!
- Go have fun.

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:28.043
- Okay.

00:02:28.043 --> 00:02:29.129
- They're gonna be peeing
all over this place.

00:02:29.129 --> 00:02:30.638
(audience laughing)

00:02:30.638 --> 00:02:32.689
- Ready, pee!
- Yeah, go!

00:02:32.689 --> 00:02:33.522
(all laughing)

00:02:33.522 --> 00:02:35.278
They're like, this is mine, this is mine.

00:02:35.278 --> 00:02:38.010
So while they're marking
their territory...

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:39.090
Oh my God, they're so cute.

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:41.040
I really don't need another dog, Barry.

